This directory contains modified copies of 13 Lean files from millennium-cook-levin
(https://github.com/JoshuaTan42/millennium-cook-levin), commit
879c4835640119ad009abeb62ebd7a96f87eb9e8, Copyright 2026 Joshua Tan, licensed under the Apache
License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory):

- Comp.lean: the composition of polynomial-time TM2 machines. The Monteverde bridges use it.
- Prog.lean, Emb.lean, CookLevin.lean, D3Fam.lean, D3OneHot.lean, D3Shift.lean, Sit.lean,
  D3Acc.lean, D3Init.lean, Asm.lean, Pre.lean, Pkg.lean: the Cook-Levin proof against the Clay
  definitions. Only the Cook-Levin cross-check (CrossCheck/) uses them.

Monteverde ported the files to Lean v4.36.0-rc2. The changes are listed in CHANGES.md and the
full diff is port.patch.
